flowchart TD
    Submit([User submits form on game page]) --> EditForm[EditForm + DataAnnotationsValidator<br/>+ BootstrapFormValidator if present]
    EditForm --> ClientRules{Client rules pass?}
    ClientRules -->|no| ClientMsg[ValidationMessage renders<br/>no network call]
    ClientMsg --> Fix[User corrects input]
    Fix --> EditForm
    ClientRules -->|yes| TypedClient[Typed HttpClient<br/>Polly retry + timeout pipeline]
    TypedClient --> SliceEndpoint[Minimal API endpoint<br/>POST /api/games/funquiz/leaderboard]
    SliceEndpoint --> AuthGate[Cookie auth middleware<br/>MicrosoftAuth or FakeAuth scheme]
    AuthGate -->|unauthenticated| Unauth[401 Unauthorized]
    AuthGate -->|authenticated| SliceHandler[Slice handler validates DTO<br/>trim-safe POCO]
    SliceHandler -->|null or missing field| BadDto[400 ProblemDetails<br/>RFC 7807 type=about:blank]
    SliceHandler -->|business rule violation| DomainFail[400 ProblemDetails<br/>type=/errors/business-rule-violation]
    SliceHandler -->|valid| StorageRepo[Storage repository UPSERT<br/>strongly typed TableEntity]
    StorageRepo -->|throttled| Throttled[503 with Retry-After header]
    StorageRepo -->|network timeout| Timeout[504 Gateway Timeout<br/>Polly retries per policy]
    StorageRepo -->|success| Success[200 OK with new entity<br/>+ Elo recompute]
    Unauth --> ClientSurface[Typed client surfaces auth error]
    BadDto --> ClientSurface
    DomainFail --> ClientSurface
    Throttled --> ClientSurface
    Timeout --> ClientSurface
    Success --> ClientSurface
    ClientSurface --> Toast[User-facing toast +<br/>structured LoggerMessage log<br/>EventId 6000-6999 range]
    Toast --> Done([End])
    ClientMsg --> Done